{"title": "Implement Screen Reader Support for UI Components", "summary": "This PR introduces screen reader support for all UI components in the CollaborateForce dashboard. It ensures that all interactive elements are properly labeled and accessible to users relying on screen readers.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/5", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "5", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_70223d0a"}, "created_at": "2026-07-20T04:28:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_13df35ed"}, "comment": "Most of the ARIA labels look good, but the dropdown menus are missing some labels. Please add the necessary ARIA labels to ensure screen readers can describe their purpose accurately.", "submitted_at": "2026-07-20T07:02:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_76d9cb07"}, "comment": "The screen reader doesn't announce the state of the toggle buttons correctly. Please ensure the toggle buttons have the correct state descriptions, indicating whether they're 'on' or 'off'.", "submitted_at": "2026-07-20T07:05:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_CollaborateForce_pull_5"}
{"title": "Add Basic API Endpoints for CollaborateForce", "summary": "Implement the foundational API endpoints to allow third-party applications to access basic functionalities of CollaborateForce, such as retrieving and posting data points.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/6", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "6", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_76d9cb07"}, "created_at": "2026-07-21T14:02:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_67416adf"}, "comment": "The retrieval endpoints look solid and return the correct data. However, the authorization checks are missing for some endpoints. Please ensure that only authorized users can access certain data.", "submitted_at": "2026-07-21T23:34:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_a1fab288"}, "comment": "The retrieval part is well done, but the posting endpoints don't update the database correctly. Additionally, please add authorization checks to ensure security.", "submitted_at": "2026-07-21T23:38:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_CollaborateForce_pull_6"}
