{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f86a00ce", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T12:28:00", "text": "Sounds good. I'll coordinate with everyone to find a suitable time.", "utterranceID": "20260404-8-6b022"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-8-6b022"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-03T12:30:00", "text": "Looking forward to it. Let's make sure we address these issues thoroughly.", "utterranceID": "20260404-9-06708"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-9-06708"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8e2042d2", "timestamp": "2026-04-05T21:03:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Market Research Report and update it based on the latest issues reported. 😊 Here are the main issues: overwhelming UI, performance with large datasets, limited integration options, occasional prediction inaccuracies, and lack of customization. Let's dive in!", "utterranceID": "20260404-0-45cf4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-0-45cf4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-04-05T21:08:00", "text": "Hey @eid_8e2042d2, for the UI issue, I think we should add a section on improving user onboarding and training resources. This could help new users navigate the interface better. Maybe we can suggest interactive tutorials or guided tours?", "utterranceID": "20260404-1-cf155"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-1-cf155"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f86a00ce", "timestamp": "2026-04-05T21:13:00", "text": "I agree with George. Also, we should consider simplifying the layout by prioritizing essential features for new users. This could be mentioned under the 'User Interface' section as a potential improvement.", "utterranceID": "20260404-2-97c52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-2-97c52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12f75faa", "timestamp": "2026-04-05T21:18:00", "text": "Regarding performance with large datasets, we should highlight the need for optimizing data processing algorithms. Perhaps we can suggest exploring more efficient memory management techniques in the 'System Architecture' section?", "utterranceID": "20260404-3-7bb68"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-3-7bb68"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-04-05T21:19:00", "text": "Good point, David. We could also add a note about enhancing resource allocation strategies to better handle large-scale data processing.", "utterranceID": "20260404-4-5530a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-4-5530a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-castAIX", "channelID": "ch-staix-62a6a5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_84600d40", "timestamp": "2026-04-05T21:21:00", "text": "For integration options, we should emphasize the importance of expanding API support to accommodate diverse data sources. This could be a key addition to the 'Integration Capabilities' section.", "utterranceID": "20260404-5-825d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-5-825d6"}

