{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:47:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Progress Bar Stalls During Import' has been resolved. You can check the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/63.", "utterranceID": "20261229-0-c0df0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-0-c0df0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:52:00", "text": "The root cause was that the progress bar wasn't linked to the asynchronous import process, which meant it didn't update in real-time and appeared unresponsive to users.", "utterranceID": "20261229-1-6a5e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-1-6a5e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:54:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the progress bar to listen for events from the import process. Now, it receives real-time updates and reflects the actual progress accurately.", "utterranceID": "20261229-2-4c99a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-2-4c99a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_07cc9100", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T17:56:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_c39dc658! This should improve the user experience significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261229-3-82fbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-3-82fbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T18:01:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian Miller! I’ll test it out and confirm everything is working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20261229-4-1af3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-4-1af3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T18:06:00", "text": "Thanks, George and Ian Jones. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20261229-5-ca17e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261229-5-ca17e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-21T16:45:00", "text": "You're welcome! Let me know if you notice any issues or have further questions.", "utterranceID": "20261121-8-bea44"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261121-8-bea44"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:38:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Thread Starvation from Background Tasks' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/59.", "utterranceID": "20261128-0-0302c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-0-0302c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:40:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_3f4b2681! Could you give us a quick rundown of what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261128-1-db36b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-1-db36b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:41:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian. The root cause was that our background tasks for lead scoring and qualification weren't properly prioritized. They were consuming too many resources, which led to the UI thread being starved and causing unresponsiveness during imports.", "utterranceID": "20261128-2-0e351"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-2-0e351"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:43:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261128-3-6846c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-3-6846c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:47:00", "text": "We implemented a priority queue for the background tasks, ensuring that the UI thread gets the necessary resources to remain responsive. Additionally, we optimized the lead scoring algorithm to reduce its resource consumption.", "utterranceID": "20261128-4-fb469"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-4-fb469"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:49:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Hannah!", "utterranceID": "20261128-5-38d39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-5-38d39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:53:00", "text": "Agreed, great work @eid_3f4b2681. This should make a big difference for our users.", "utterranceID": "20261128-6-342b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-6-342b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:55:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. Happy to help!", "utterranceID": "20261128-7-1682c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-7-1682c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in Lead Data Export' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/60.", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-4e189"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-4e189"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:19:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Can you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-7f34a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-7f34a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:24:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was that the export module lacked proper encryption protocols for securing data during file generation. This led to sensitive lead information being exposed during the export process.", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-b3825"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-b3825"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-d5d00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-d5d00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:32:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented AES-256 encryption for the exported files. This ensures that all sensitive lead data is securely encrypted during the export process. Additionally, I added a verification step to ensure that the encryption is applied correctly before the files are made available for download.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-6aca5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-6aca5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:33:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix, Ian. Thanks for handling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T18:25:00", "text": "@eid_99835861 created this channel on 2026-09-11 18:25:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-ianjones-LeadForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-53655"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-53655"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T18:25:00", "text": "@eid_99835861 joined bug-ianjones-LeadForce. Also, @eid_3f4b2681, @eid_c39dc658, @eid_652e8cd0, @eid_07cc9100, @eid_9f4e2c6f joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-bdd26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-bdd26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:06:00", "text": "Hey team! 👋 We've got a few customer-reported issues that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one.", "utterranceID": "20260911-0-329f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-0-329f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:08:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Feature Drift Causes Inconsistent Scoring'. The AI Scoring Algorithm isn't reflecting changes in lead behavior over time, leading to inconsistent and outdated lead scores. This is impacting CUST-0020, and it could mean missed opportunities or wasted resources on low-quality leads. @eid_9f4e2c6f, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260911-1-3feb6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-1-3feb6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:13:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the AI Scoring Algorithm and see what's causing the drift. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260911-2-33b1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-2-33b1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Misconfigured Export Permissions' issue. Users are able to export more data than they're authorized to, which could lead to data breaches. This is affecting CUST-0069. @eid_9f4e2c6f, you're on this one too.", "utterranceID": "20260911-3-1276e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-3-1276e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:19:00", "text": "Understood. I'll check the Data Export Module and fix the permissions. We definitely don't want any data breaches! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260911-4-7aaca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-4-7aaca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:23:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Lastly, we have an 'Improper Access Control in Export API' issue. Unauthorized users can access and export lead data, which is a big no-no. This is impacting CUST-0037. @eid_3f4b2681, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260911-5-ae35b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-5-ae35b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:25:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll look into the access control mechanisms in the Export API and tighten things up. Thanks for assigning it to me! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260911-6-9917e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-6-9917e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:26:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260911-7-c75b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-7-c75b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:29:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_99835861! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260911-8-5a937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-8-5a937"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_99835861! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260911-9-80937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-9-80937"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-14T10:45:00", "text": "Hi team! 👋 Let's take a look at some similar issues from open-source projects that might give us insights into our current bugs. First up, we have a bug from TensorFlow.", "utterranceID": "20260914-0-fe8e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260914-0-fe8e6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:18:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261027-3-592db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-3-592db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:19:00", "text": "I updated the cache invalidation policies to ensure they trigger on all relevant lead data updates. Specifically, I added hooks to the update functions that now correctly flag the cache for invalidation whenever lead data changes.", "utterranceID": "20261027-4-a6d22"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-4-a6d22"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:21:00", "text": "Nice work, Fiona! This should improve the user experience significantly. Thanks for handling it so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261027-5-3053d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-5-3053d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:26:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! If anyone notices any further issues, please let me know. Otherwise, we should be good to go.", "utterranceID": "20261027-6-83a0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-6-83a0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:28:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Thanks again for the swift resolution!", "utterranceID": "20261027-7-8a0ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-7-8a0ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T01:52:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect lead scoring due to data mismatch has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/52.", "utterranceID": "20261031-0-cb67e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-0-cb67e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T01:56:00", "text": "The root cause was an outdated data mapping configuration that didn't align with the recent updates in our data schema.", "utterranceID": "20261031-1-e3d57"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-1-e3d57"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona! Can you explain how you fixed it?", "utterranceID": "20261031-2-72b31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-2-72b31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:04:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. I updated the data mapping configuration to match the current input data format. This involved modifying the mapping logic to ensure it dynamically adapts to schema changes in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261031-3-981b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-3-981b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:08:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_a43a4389! Does this mean we won't face similar issues with future schema updates?", "utterranceID": "20261031-4-60b1c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-4-60b1c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:13:00", "text": "Exactly, Ian. The new configuration should automatically adjust to any schema changes, reducing the risk of similar issues.", "utterranceID": "20261031-5-589c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-5-589c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:16:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona. I'll run some tests on my end to ensure everything's working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261031-6-4a0cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-6-4a0cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:19:00", "text": "Sounds good, @eid_207da0e7. Let me know if you encounter any issues.", "utterranceID": "20261031-7-8b39f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-7-8b39f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:23:00", "text": "Thanks again, Fiona. This should really help improve our lead scoring accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20261031-8-61555"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-8-61555"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:28:00", "text": "You're welcome, Charlie. Happy to help!", "utterranceID": "20261031-9-279d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-9-279d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:34:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Freezes During Bulk Lead Import' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/53.", "utterranceID": "20261103-0-07766"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-0-07766"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T15:37:00", "text": "The root cause was that the UI thread was getting blocked due to synchronous processing of bulk data imports. This was causing the interface to become unresponsive.", "utterranceID": "20261103-1-49a61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261103-1-49a61"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-12-06T11:59:00", "text": "Thanks, David. That should help avoid similar reports in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261206-10-5ce3d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261206-10-5ce3d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-08T18:57:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect lead scores due to the stale cache issue has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/61.", "utterranceID": "20261208-0-fe9d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-0-fe9d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-08T18:58:00", "text": "The root cause was a bug in the cache invalidation logic, which failed to clear or update cache entries when the underlying data changed. This led to outdated lead data being served.", "utterranceID": "20261208-1-22f75"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-1-22f75"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-08T19:03:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the cache invalidation policy to trigger a refresh whenever there are changes in the lead data. This ensures that the cache always serves the most recent data.", "utterranceID": "20261208-2-2c6c4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-2-2c6c4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-12-08T19:05:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_a23a73c4! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. This should improve the accuracy of our lead scores significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261208-3-07544"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261208-3-07544"}
