{"title": "Update Authentication Service for JWT Support", "summary": "This PR updates the existing authentication service to integrate JWT support. It modifies the login process to issue JWT tokens and updates the user session management to rely on JWT tokens.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/pAIX/pull/16", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "True", "number": "16", "state": "closed", "user": {"login": "eid_022d1fd9"}, "created_at": "2026-09-23T22:24:00", "reviews": [{"state": "APPROVED", "user": {"login": "eid_dd1ff0ca"}, "comment": "The authentication service is issuing JWT tokens correctly upon login, and the user session management is updated to use JWT tokens instead of session cookies. Nice work! LGTM, approved! 🎉", "submitted_at": "2026-09-24T08:22:00"}, {"state": "PENDING", "user": {"login": "eid_81582c30"}, "comment": "The backward compatibility for existing authentication mechanisms is well-maintained. I ran the tests, and everything seems to be working perfectly. Great job on adding comprehensive tests for the new flow! Same here, LGTM! Approved! 🙌", "submitted_at": "2026-09-24T08:27:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_pAIX_pull_16"}
{"title": "Integrate User Feedback Mechanism into UI", "summary": "This PR integrates a feedback mechanism within the user interface, allowing users to easily submit feedback about their experience and suggest improvements.", "link": "https://github.com/salesforce/pAIX/pull/17", "mergeable": "True", "merged": "False", "number": "17", "state": "open", "user": {"login": "eid_81582c30"}, "created_at": "2026-09-24T13:38:00", "reviews": [{"state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "user": {"login": "eid_da6c2317"}, "comment": "The feedback button is well integrated and visible across all major sections. However, the confirmation message isn't displaying after feedback submission. Please address this issue.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-25T01:29:00"}, {"state": "COMMENTED", "user": {"login": "eid_48e149b5"}, "comment": "The backend integration looks solid, and the feedback is being stored correctly in the database. However, the confirmation message needs to be fixed. Once that's addressed, the PR should be good to go.", "submitted_at": "2026-09-25T01:33:00"}], "id": "github_com_salesforce_pAIX_pull_17"}

