{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ProposalForce", "channelID": "ch-alaix-ddb7c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_965867b8", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T05:29:00", "text": "Great point, Hannah. Their advanced features are priced about 20-30% higher than the industry average. This could deter smaller businesses or startups from opting for their service.", "utterranceID": "20270213-6-dd8a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270213-6-dd8a3"}
