{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:24:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about improper access control in query execution has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/33.", "utterranceID": "20270322-0-76d84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-0-76d84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:28:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_4eec2a5a! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270322-1-1c49d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-1-1c49d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:29:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was a misconfiguration in the access control logic within the query execution pipeline. It wasn't properly verifying user permissions, which allowed unauthorized users to access restricted data.", "utterranceID": "20270322-2-ebec9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-2-ebec9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:32:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270322-3-a38ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-3-a38ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:33:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the access control logic to ensure that user permissions are checked before any query execution. I also added additional unit tests to cover various permission scenarios to prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270322-4-50e10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-4-50e10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:36:00", "text": "Nice work, Alice! Adding those tests will definitely help us catch any similar issues early on.", "utterranceID": "20270322-5-471c7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-5-471c7"}

