{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-09T23:41:00", "text": "@eid_539907c1 joined planning-shAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260909-40-508a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260909-40-508a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:26:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for shAIX is that some users are having difficulty customizing search parameters to fit their specific business needs. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0032.", "utterranceID": "20261006-0-40d7b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-0-40d7b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-11T01:30:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices. Could it be that the user interface has limited options for customization?", "utterranceID": "20261006-1-dc306"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-1-dc306"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:38:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! If anyone has further questions or needs more details, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270322-6-555d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-6-555d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T06:40:00", "text": "Thanks for the hard work, Alice. This fix will definitely improve our system's security.", "utterranceID": "20270322-7-d85eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270322-7-d85eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:17:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect font scaling in the search results has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20270323-0-fbb43"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-0-fbb43"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:20:00", "text": "Great news, George! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270323-1-e0889"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-1-e0889"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:25:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The issue was due to font sizes not being dynamically adjusted based on the device pixel ratio and screen size. This led to inconsistent text rendering, causing overlapping text and truncated information.", "utterranceID": "20270323-2-e41a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-2-e41a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:28:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, @eid_12c203a5. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270323-3-0a60c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-3-0a60c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:31:00", "text": "I updated the CSS to use relative units like 'em' and 'rem' instead of fixed pixel values. Additionally, I implemented a media query to adjust font sizes based on the screen size and device pixel ratio. This ensures that text elements scale properly across different devices.", "utterranceID": "20270323-4-2fbef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-4-2fbef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:32:00", "text": "Nice work, George! That should make the UI much more consistent across devices.", "utterranceID": "20270323-5-1f337"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-5-1f337"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! Let me know if you encounter any more issues.", "utterranceID": "20270323-6-bfe2f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-6-bfe2f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:38:00", "text": "Will do, George. Thanks for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20270323-7-b9577"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-7-b9577"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-23T13:43:00", "text": "Yes, thanks for the fix, George. I'll test it out and let you know if anything else comes up.", "utterranceID": "20270323-8-2ff19"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270323-8-2ff19"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:12:00", "text": "Hi team, the 'Font Scaling Inconsistencies' bug has been reopened by the customer. It seems the issue is still persisting for some users. 😕", "utterranceID": "20270329-0-38b0b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-0-38b0b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:15:00", "text": "Oh no, I thought we had that one sorted out! 😅 @David Williams, do we have any more details on what the customer is experiencing?", "utterranceID": "20270329-1-2338a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-1-2338a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:19:00", "text": "Yeah, it looks like the text overlap is still happening on certain devices. They mentioned it's particularly bad on smaller screens. 📱", "utterranceID": "20270329-2-0dee7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-2-0dee7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:22:00", "text": "That's odd. @George Johnson, did you test it on multiple devices before marking it as resolved?", "utterranceID": "20270329-3-1615c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-3-1615c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:24:00", "text": "I did test it on a few, but maybe I missed some edge cases. I'll take another look at it. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270329-4-4afb7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-4-4afb7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:25:00", "text": "Let me know if you need any help with testing, George. I can run it through some additional devices on BrowserStack. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270329-5-88170"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-5-88170"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T08:11:00", "text": "@here check our product demo here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/SearchForce/demo_2", "utterranceID": "20261023-0-07775"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261023-0-07775"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T17:43:00", "text": "@eid_3fa288cf joined develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce.", "utterranceID": "20261027-41-92dda"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-41-92dda"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:36:00", "text": "Hi team, I hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to kick off a discussion about our proposed PR to enhance the search bar UI. I've found some similar features from open-source projects that might give us some inspiration. Let's dive in!", "utterranceID": "20261027-0-36d43"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-0-36d43"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:40:00", "text": "First up, we have a PR from WordPress titled 'Revamp Search Widget for Enhanced Usability'. It focuses on redesigning the search widget with a new layout and updated styling. You can check it out here: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/3982. What do you think, @eid_b20b58ad?", "utterranceID": "20261027-1-b9c92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-1-b9c92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:41:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! The WordPress redesign looks pretty sleek. I like how they've simplified the layout, which could definitely make the search experience more intuitive. It might be worth considering a similar approach for our project. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261027-2-94cab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-2-94cab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:45:00", "text": "I agree with Julia. The updated styling in WordPress is quite user-friendly. We should definitely think about how we can incorporate some of these elements into our design. Maybe a cleaner layout could help us too.", "utterranceID": "20261027-3-c4897"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-3-c4897"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:47:00", "text": "Great points, both of you! Next, let's look at Mozilla Firefox's 'Intuitive Search Bar Redesign'. This PR updates the search bar UI with improved iconography and a new color scheme. Here's the link: https://github.com/mozilla/firefox/pull/3983. Thoughts, Alice?", "utterranceID": "20261027-4-dd6d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-4-dd6d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:49:00", "text": "The Firefox redesign is interesting. I really like their use of iconography to guide users. It seems like a small change, but it can make a big difference in usability. We should definitely consider how icons can enhance our search bar. @eid_b20b58ad, what do you think?", "utterranceID": "20261027-5-64879"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-5-64879"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:53:00", "text": "I think you're spot on, Alice. Icons can really help with user navigation. Plus, their color scheme is quite appealing. We should experiment with some of these ideas in our design. 🎨", "utterranceID": "20261027-6-62973"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-6-62973"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-shaix-a65760"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3fa288cf", "timestamp": "2026-10-28T02:57:00", "text": "Awesome insights! Lastly, let's discuss GIMP's 'Enhanced Search Tool Interface'. This PR focuses on improving the search tool interface for better accessibility and user interaction. Check it out here: https://github.com/GNOME/gimp/pull/3984. Any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261027-7-ce6fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-7-ce6fb"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T06:40:00", "text": "@eid_6d14c4ec created this channel on 2027-02-22 06:40:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20270222-0-c3f31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-0-c3f31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T06:40:00", "text": "@eid_6d14c4ec joined bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce. Also, @eid_12c203a5, @eid_681e9def, @eid_b20b58ad, @eid_4eec2a5a joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20270222-1-95695"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-1-95695"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:40:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SearchForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270222-0-ee114"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-0-ee114"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:42:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Cache Invalidation Issue'. The caching layer isn't invalidating correctly, causing outdated data to be served. This is impacting CUST-0084, and users are experiencing delays in search results. @eid_12c203a5, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270222-1-d8d12"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-1-d8d12"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:44:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the cache invalidation logic and see what's causing the delay. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270222-2-5f7f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-2-5f7f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:49:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Slow Response Time During Peak Usage'. This is affecting the backend infrastructure and causing delays for CUST-0044 during high activity periods. @eid_681e9def, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270222-3-627fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-3-627fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:53:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll check the backend load handling and see if we need to optimize anything for peak times. Let's get this sorted! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270222-4-00042"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-4-00042"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T19:57:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an 'Indexing Delay After Data Update'. This is affecting both the database and caching layer, leading to outdated search results for CUST-0045. @eid_4eec2a5a, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270222-5-5ee0d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-5-5ee0d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:02:00", "text": "On it! I'll dive into the indexing process and see why it's lagging behind. Let's make sure our data is fresh and accurate. 🕵️‍♂️", "utterranceID": "20270222-6-f1073"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-6-f1073"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:03:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or resources. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270222-7-5c752"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-7-5c752"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:04:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on the cache issue. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20270222-8-4a42a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-8-4a42a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:07:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the backend performance. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270222-9-fa079"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-9-fa079"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-02-22T20:10:00", "text": "I'll share my findings on the indexing delay soon. Let's get these resolved! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270222-10-7bf47"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270222-10-7bf47"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-02-26T05:16:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current Salesforce issues. Let's take a look at them together! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270225-0-e1f72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270225-0-e1f72"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! That would be super helpful. I'll start by reviewing the previous fix and see where it might be failing. @David Williams, could you reassign the bug to me?", "utterranceID": "20270329-6-dc863"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-6-dc863"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:33:00", "text": "Sure thing, George. I'll update the ticket and assign it back to you. Let's aim to get this resolved quickly for the customer. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270329-7-e7671"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-7-e7671"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-29T11:34:00", "text": "Got it! I'll keep everyone posted on the progress. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270329-8-64125"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270329-8-64125"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T21:32:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect context retention in long queries, titled 'Contextual Drift in Long Queries', has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20270330-0-f9626"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270330-0-f9626"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T21:36:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as a failure in the NLP engine's context retention mechanism. It couldn't maintain the intended context throughout the parsing of lengthy queries, which led to a drift in understanding and partially relevant search results.", "utterranceID": "20270330-1-bb63c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270330-1-bb63c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b20b58ad", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T21:39:00", "text": "To fix this, we implemented a dynamic context window that adjusts based on query length. This ensures that the context is consistently maintained, regardless of how detailed the query is. We also added additional checkpoints to verify context accuracy at various stages of parsing.", "utterranceID": "20270330-2-62cb4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270330-2-62cb4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-30T21:40:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_b20b58ad! This should significantly improve the user experience for those using detailed queries.", "utterranceID": "20270330-3-fc59d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270330-3-fc59d"}
