{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T05:44:00", "text": "Totally, Julia. Metabase's approach to expanding their library could help us prioritize which chart types to add next. We should definitely keep this in mind as we move forward. 📈", "utterranceID": "20261112-9-cd79b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-9-cd79b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T05:45:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, everyone! I'll take a closer look at these PRs and see how we can incorporate some of their ideas into our feature. Let's aim to make our visualization options as robust and user-friendly as possible! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261112-10-b9a5e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-10-b9a5e"}
