{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T20:19:00", "text": "@eid_8605f7ee joined develop-alicemartinez-FForceAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260524-3-70e6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-3-70e6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T22:29:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to discuss some open-source projects that have implemented similar visualization features to what we're planning for our Analytics Dashboard. Let's see if we can draw any inspiration or ideas from them. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260524-0-71a76"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-0-71a76"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T22:32:00", "text": "First up, Apache Superset has a PR titled 'Enhanced Charting Library' which introduces new chart types like scatter plots and heatmaps. You can check it out here: https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/3301. What do you think, @eid_fc0f17c3?", "utterranceID": "20260524-1-a6b87"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-1-a6b87"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T22:35:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! Scatter plots and heatmaps could definitely add depth to our data visualization. I think heatmaps, in particular, could be really useful for showing data density. We should consider how these could fit into our current dashboard layout. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260524-2-108d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-2-108d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T22:36:00", "text": "Great point, Fiona! Next, let's look at Grafana's PR 'Customizable Dashboard Widgets'. It allows users to add and configure new widget types like radial gauges and histograms. Here's the link: https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/3302. Thoughts, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260524-3-8c80d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-3-8c80d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T22:41:00", "text": "Radial gauges could be a cool addition for showing performance metrics at a glance. Histograms might be a bit niche for our current use cases, but it's worth considering if we expand our data types. Grafana's flexibility is impressive! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260524-4-274fa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-4-274fa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T22:46:00", "text": "Totally agree, Charlie! Lastly, Metabase has a PR called 'Advanced Data Visualization Tools' which adds support for waterfall charts and bubble charts. Check it out here: https://github.com/metabase/metabase/pull/3303. Any thoughts, @eid_fc0f17c3?", "utterranceID": "20260524-5-fa0e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-5-fa0e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-05-24T22:47:00", "text": "Waterfall charts could be really useful for financial data analysis, showing cumulative effects. Bubble charts are great for multi-variable data. We should definitely consider these for future updates. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260524-6-791a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260524-6-791a3"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T18:29:00", "text": "Hey @eid_8605f7ee, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. Excited to see the improvements! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260708-1-ab282"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260708-1-ab282"}
