{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T18:35:00", "text": "Just went through the PR, and the design looks sleek and modern! The responsiveness on mobile and tablet is spot on. Great job on that front! 📱💻", "utterranceID": "20260708-3-8ba6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260708-3-8ba6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T18:36:00", "text": "Agreed with @Charlie Miller, the responsiveness is impressive. However, I noticed that some of the user interactions aren't as intuitive as they could be. For example, the filter options on the dashboard could be more prominent. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260708-4-bcb56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260708-4-bcb56"}
