{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T18:48:00", "text": "No worries, @eid_8605f7ee. Once you make those tweaks, I think we'll be in a good spot. Let us know when the updates are ready, and we'll give it another look. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260708-8-42cd8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260708-8-42cd8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-07-08T18:52:00", "text": "Will do, @Ian Miller! Thanks for the constructive feedback, everyone. I'll ping you once the changes are made. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260708-9-d7361"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260708-9-d7361"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ba9224d2", "timestamp": "2026-07-15T23:37:00", "text": "Hi team, I hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to kick off a discussion about our proposed PR to enhance the UI/UX of our Analytics Dashboard. To guide our implementation, I've found some similar features from open-source projects that we can learn from. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260715-0-6db4a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260715-0-6db4a"}
