{"Channel": {"name": "develop-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-29b8e9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc0f17c3", "timestamp": "2026-06-24T18:26:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian! I'll take a closer look at their implementation and see what insights we can gather. Now, let's move on to Apache Superset's [React Component Library for Dashboards](https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/3311). They developed a set of reusable components to streamline dashboard creation. Julia, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260624-4-ebbb3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260624-4-ebbb3"}
