{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T23:28:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_b7702c98! Next, we have an issue with **Inaccurate Forecasts Due to Data Preprocessing Error**. The AI model is generating inaccurate forecasts due to errors in data preprocessing, affecting the Data Preprocessing Module. This is impacting customer CUST-0006. @eid_57e922c4, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260824-3-4e012"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-3-4e012"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T23:33:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll dive into the data preprocessing logic and identify where the errors are occurring. Ensuring accurate forecasts is key for our users' decision-making. 📊", "utterranceID": "20260824-4-81422"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-4-81422"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-08-24T23:36:00", "text": "Great, thanks @eid_57e922c4! Lastly, we have an **Inefficient Query Execution Plan** issue. The database query optimizer is selecting suboptimal execution plans, causing delays. This affects the Database Management System and impacts customer CUST-0056. @eid_b7702c98, can you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260824-5-28a04"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260824-5-28a04"}
