{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidtaylor-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-staix-e2bea9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:32:00", "text": "Thanks for the feedback, @eid_bef4290f and George! I must have missed that part. I'll work on integrating the test results with our reporting dashboard. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260801-5-1c8b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260801-5-1c8b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidtaylor-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-staix-e2bea9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fe9e7eee", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T05:34:00", "text": "Also, I noticed that the CI/CD pipeline doesn't currently include these integration tests as a mandatory step. We should ensure that they run automatically with every build. @eid_1bf91687, can you add that to the pipeline?", "utterranceID": "20260801-6-feca9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260801-6-feca9"}
