{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:30:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_13cb0e90! Can you give us a quick rundown of what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-1-9f3bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:32:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian. The root cause was that our API Integration Module wasn't converting timestamps to a consistent timezone before processing. This led to temporal data inconsistencies and inaccurate sentiment trends.", "utterranceID": "20261219-2-87113"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-2-87113"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:36:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261219-3-56141"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-3-56141"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2026-12-19T07:40:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I updated the API Integration Module to include a timezone conversion step. Now, all incoming timestamps are converted to UTC before any processing occurs. This ensures consistency across all data points.", "utterranceID": "20261219-4-917da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261219-4-917da"}

