{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T23:56:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261002-0-ee9a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-0-ee9a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T23:58:00", "text": "First, there's a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Incorrect Emoji Sentiment Classification'. It seems their sentiment analysis model is also misclassifying emojis, similar to our SentimentForce issue. You can check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/163. @eid_4df5d4b7, this might give you some insights!", "utterranceID": "20261002-1-852a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-1-852a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:03:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their fixes to our emoji interpretation logic. It's always good to see how others tackle similar problems. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261002-2-5fbbd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-2-5fbbd"}
