{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e51b439b", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T19:33:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Let's keep the momentum going!", "utterranceID": "20260825-10-b3f3d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-10-b3f3d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T04:44:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for EF_AIX is limited integration options with third-party applications. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0028.", "utterranceID": "20260825-0-4510f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-0-4510f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df282afb", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T04:47:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Julia. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices.", "utterranceID": "20260825-1-331ea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-1-331ea"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-08-30T04:50:00", "text": "Could it be a technical issue? Maybe there aren't enough APIs or connectors for seamless integration.", "utterranceID": "20260825-2-95846"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-2-95846"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:26:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some feedback from the latest release of EF_AIX that we need to address. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260918-0-defa9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-0-defa9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a253c65a", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:30:00", "text": "Hey Charlie, I think we should start by enhancing the 'User Experience' section. The setup process is currently too complex. We could add a subsection on 'Setup Automation' and detail scripts or tools that could simplify this process. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260918-1-1d2ec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-1-1d2ec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a9002ae2", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:34:00", "text": "@Hannah Brown, I agree. Also, we should expand the 'User Experience' section to include more detailed user guidance. Maybe a step-by-step guide or a video tutorial link? This could help non-technical users a lot. 📚", "utterranceID": "20260918-2-c2bf8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-2-c2bf8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c9c3d8d5", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:35:00", "text": "Good point, Bob. We should also consider adding a 'Support Resources' section under 'Operational' to outline available support channels and resources. This could address the lack of support during setup. 📞", "utterranceID": "20260918-3-c9ddd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-3-c9ddd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9db3abf4", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:39:00", "text": "For the performance issues, we might need to revisit the 'Edge Processing Layer' section. We should specify improvements in data processing algorithms and resource management. Maybe add a note on optimizing for large datasets? 📈", "utterranceID": "20260918-4-e5750"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-4-e5750"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1a7d9807", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:42:00", "text": "Agreed, Alice. We should also mention the need for hardware compatibility checks in the 'Device Layer' section to ensure consistent performance across different devices. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260918-5-40cb8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-5-40cb8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_caa2e58d", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:43:00", "text": "Regarding integration, the 'Integration Layer' should include a plan for developing more APIs and connectors. This will help with third-party application integration. Let's make it a priority in the development roadmap. 🔗", "utterranceID": "20260918-6-35b70"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-6-35b70"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2d8eff4d", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:44:00", "text": "And for the UI issues, we should add a 'User Feedback Loop' section in the 'User Experience' part. This can help us continuously improve the UI based on user input. 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20260918-7-35619"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-7-35619"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-18T20:46:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll add setup automation details, enhance user guidance, outline support resources, optimize data processing, ensure hardware compatibility, expand integration options, and incorporate user feedback. Let's update the document accordingly and schedule a follow-up meeting to review the changes. Thanks for the input! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260918-8-f1ae0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-8-f1ae0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T08:54:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_ef_aix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260918-0-abe02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260918-0-abe02"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-EF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-30c6d3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4b38019b", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T08:57:39", "text": "@here Read about the latest advancements in edge AI technology and its potential to drive innovation in this TechCrunch article. https://techcrunch.com/2023/02/15/edge-ai-advancements/", "utterranceID": "20260919-137-7c026"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260919-137-7c026"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-16T21:29:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is definitely relevant. The TensorFlow team seems to have tackled it by refining their hyperparameter tuning process. I'll review their approach and see how we can apply similar strategies to our system. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270116-2-09ec8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270116-2-09ec8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-16T21:31:00", "text": "Great! Next, there's a 'Weak API Authentication' issue in Django. The PR highlights inadequate authentication mechanisms in their REST framework, which exposes APIs to unauthorized access. Here's the link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/1060. Julia Smith, this aligns with our API security concerns. What do you think? 🔐", "utterranceID": "20270116-3-11280"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270116-3-11280"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-16T21:32:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia! The Django team has implemented more robust authentication protocols. I'll dig into their solution and see how we can enhance our API security. Security is key! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270116-4-9eddd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270116-4-9eddd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-16T21:33:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Vulnerable Edge Device Firmware' issue in OpenWrt. The PR discusses security vulnerabilities in firmware that could be exploited, risking user data. Here's the link: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/1061. This is quite similar to our edge device firmware issue. @eid_2347b567, any insights? 🛡️", "utterranceID": "20270116-5-aa68d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270116-5-aa68d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-16T21:36:00", "text": "On it! The OpenWrt team has been proactive in patching these vulnerabilities. I'll review their patches and see how we can apply similar fixes to our firmware. Keeping our devices secure is a top priority! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270116-6-1fb84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270116-6-1fb84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-16T21:38:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia Smith! Appreciate your proactive approach on all these issues. Let's keep the communication open and ensure our solutions are robust. If anyone has questions or needs more info, feel free to ask! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270116-7-7a4b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270116-7-7a4b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2347b567", "timestamp": "2027-01-16T21:42:00", "text": "Will do! If I need any additional info or run into any roadblocks, I'll reach out. Thanks for coordinating, Julia Martinez! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270116-8-9f987"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270116-8-9f987"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-18T20:23:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with EdgeForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270118-0-db28c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-0-db28c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_91523bad", "timestamp": "2027-01-18T20:25:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Inconsistent Model Visualization Updates'. The problem is that model visualizations aren't updating consistently when new data is processed. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Module and is causing frustration for users like CUST-0041. @eid_4df3bcc2, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270118-1-3c041"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-1-3c041"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliamartinez-EdgeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7bfbef"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df3bcc2", "timestamp": "2027-01-18T20:29:00", "text": "Got it! I'll look into the visualization updates and see what's causing the discrepancies. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270118-2-16cd9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270118-2-16cd9"}

