{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:50:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with the FlowForce feature. Let's go through them and assign accordingly. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-ab73f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-ab73f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:51:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'API Flow Analysis Incorrectly Identifies Bottlenecks'. The AI Model & Analysis Engine is inaccurately flagging certain API endpoints as bottlenecks, which could lead to unnecessary optimizations. This is impacting customer CUST-0029. @eid_d0d918f1, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-8214d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-8214d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:55:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the AI Model & Analysis Engine and see what's causing the false positives. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-559c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-559c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T22:59:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Suboptimal Load Balancing Algorithm' issue. The load balancing isn't distributing API requests evenly, causing some servers to overload. This is affecting customer CUST-0038. @eid_d098d618, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-c7106"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-c7106"}

