{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicetaylor-MonitorForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7ef125"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5b9ab912", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T11:44:00", "text": "Great, Fiona! Next, there's an 'Incorrect Anomaly Detection Thresholds' issue in TensorFlow. Their AI models are setting incorrect thresholds, leading to false positives, just like our Metrics Collection Module issue with CUST-0112. Check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/1672. Ian, any thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260720-3-d6a23"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260720-3-d6a23"}
