{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T02:48:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue in Bootstrap titled 'Inconsistent Grid Layout on Mobile Browsers'. It seems their grid system isn't displaying consistently across different mobile browsers, which is quite similar to our 'Inconsistent Layout Across Mobile Browsers' issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/pull/392. @Ian Martinez, any thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20270103-1-6136b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270103-1-6136b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T02:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This is definitely relevant to what I'm working on. I'll review their PR to see how they tackled the layout inconsistencies. It might give us some insights into resolving our mobile UI issues. 📱", "utterranceID": "20270103-2-1fd2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270103-2-1fd2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-01-04T02:54:00", "text": "Great, Ian! Next, there's an issue in Express.js titled 'Overly Permissive CORS Configuration'. Their default CORS settings are too permissive, similar to our 'CORS Misconfiguration' issue. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/expressjs/express/pull/393. Fiona, could you take a look at this?", "utterranceID": "20270103-3-d78b6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270103-3-d78b6"}
