{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:15:00", "text": "After reviewing the issue, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20260921-2-72c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-2-72c6a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T16:57:00", "text": "Great, Ian! Next, we have a bug in the OAuth2 Proxy project titled 'Incorrect Token Refresh Handling'. This one deals with OAuth tokens not refreshing automatically, causing authentication errors. Sounds familiar, right? Here's the PR link: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/180. Ian, since you're already on the OAuth token issue, could you take a look at this one too?", "utterranceID": "20261122-3-ef534"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-3-ef534"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T17:01:00", "text": "Absolutely, Emma! I'll dive into the OAuth2 Proxy PR and see if their solution can help us with our token refresh problem. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261122-4-6d67b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-4-6d67b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T17:02:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! Lastly, we have a bug in the Kafka project titled 'Inconsistent Message Deduplication'. This is about duplicate messages not being filtered properly, which is similar to our deduplication issue. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/181. Fiona, could you check this one out?", "utterranceID": "20261122-5-3a283"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-5-3a283"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T17:04:00", "text": "Sure thing, Emma! I'll review the Kafka PR and see if their approach to message deduplication can help us improve our sentiment analysis accuracy. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261122-6-ede7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-6-ede7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T17:08:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's see what we can learn from these open-source projects. If you find anything useful, let's discuss how we can integrate it into our solutions. Keep me posted! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261122-7-45173"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-7-45173"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T17:13:00", "text": "Will do, Emma! Thanks for finding these resources. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261122-8-73a85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-8-73a85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-22T17:15:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll update you on any progress. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261122-9-f9132"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-9-f9132"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T08:24:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent message deduplication has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20261124-0-a9dde"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261124-0-a9dde"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T08:26:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as a flaw in the deduplication logic within the API Integration Module. Specifically, it was due to hash collisions and improper handling of message IDs, which caused duplicate messages to slip through and be processed multiple times.", "utterranceID": "20261124-1-59c53"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261124-1-59c53"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T08:27:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona! How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261124-2-c3ee6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261124-2-c3ee6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T08:31:00", "text": "Good question, @eid_d96fb219. I updated the deduplication logic to use a combination of message content hashing and a unique message ID check. This ensures that even if a hash collision occurs, the message ID will help accurately filter out duplicates.", "utterranceID": "20261124-3-29736"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261124-3-29736"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T08:34:00", "text": "Great work, Fiona! This should really help improve the accuracy of our sentiment analysis.", "utterranceID": "20261124-4-65f90"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261124-4-65f90"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T08:39:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! Please let me know if you notice any further issues or have any questions.", "utterranceID": "20261124-5-2fb63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261124-5-2fb63"}

