{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:16:00", "text": "Absolutely, thanks for coordinating, Emma! Let's get these issues sorted out. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261002-9-b432b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-9-b432b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:40:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261006-0-953d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-0-953d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:42:00", "text": "The root cause was due to a lack of updated statistics and missing query optimization hints, which led to the database generating suboptimal execution plans for retrieving sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20261006-1-6de80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-1-6de80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:47:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the statistics on the relevant tables and added specific query optimization hints to guide the database management system towards more efficient execution paths.", "utterranceID": "20261006-2-455fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-2-455fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:51:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_fa6ec727! This should help improve the query processing times significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-f16c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-f16c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:55:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob and Emma! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261006-5-f96d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-5-f96d0"}
