{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_47d43bc4", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T10:02:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to discuss PR# 5 regarding the integration with Slack's Events API. It seems the product direction has changed, and this integration might no longer be necessary. What are your thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261202-0-90555"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261202-0-90555"}
