{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:15:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with CollaborateForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261222-0-f04ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-0-f04ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:19:00", "text": "First up, we have the 'Rate Limiting Misalignment' issue. External applications are facing unexpected rate limiting, which is impacting the API Authentication Layer. This is causing frustration for developers as they can't integrate seamlessly. Impacted customer: CUST-0040.", "utterranceID": "20261222-1-123b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-1-123b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:21:00", "text": "Next, there's the 'Delayed Data Propagation' issue. Users are experiencing significant delays in data updates from the database to the UI, which could lead to miscommunication during collaborative sessions. Affected customer: CUST-0052.", "utterranceID": "20261222-2-79b74"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-2-79b74"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:25:00", "text": "Lastly, we have a 'Token Expiry Mismanagement' issue. Session tokens aren't being invalidated properly after logout, posing a security risk. This affects the Security Module and could expose sensitive data. Impacted customer: CUST-0094.", "utterranceID": "20261222-3-12db9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-3-12db9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:28:00", "text": "All these issues are assigned to @eid_76d9cb07. Can you confirm you'll take these on? Let me know if you need any additional info! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261222-4-3aa63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-4-3aa63"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:33:00", "text": "Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_0c373165! I'll start with the 'Rate Limiting Misalignment' issue. I'll dig into the API Authentication Layer and see what's causing the unexpected rate limiting. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261222-5-5c56b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-5-5c56b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:36:00", "text": "For the 'Delayed Data Propagation' issue, I'll check the database and UI integration to identify the bottleneck. Ensuring real-time data updates is crucial for our users. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261222-6-06b2f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-6-06b2f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:37:00", "text": "Regarding the 'Token Expiry Mismanagement', I'll review the Security Module to ensure session tokens are invalidated correctly. Security is a top priority! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261222-7-f65dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-7-f65dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_76d9cb07", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:38:00", "text": "I'll keep everyone updated on my progress. If anyone has insights or suggestions, feel free to share! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261222-8-85ffc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-8-85ffc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-600c17"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-12-22T15:39:00", "text": "Great, thanks @eid_76d9cb07! Let us know if you hit any roadblocks. Team, feel free to jump in if you have any ideas or can lend a hand. Let's get these resolved for our customers! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261222-9-0e9ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261222-9-0e9ad"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_724e1180", "timestamp": "2027-02-28T08:42:00", "text": "This is spot on, Bob! The Node.js issue could provide valuable insights into optimizing our backend server. I'll dive into their PR and see what strategies they used. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270227-4-2ae53"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270227-4-2ae53"}
