{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:25:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect token expiry times, titled 'Token Expiry Mismatch', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/67.", "utterranceID": "20270321-0-eebe2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-0-eebe2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:29:00", "text": "The root cause was a discrepancy between the token expiry time set in our CollaborateForce API and the expiry time recognized by external applications. This was due to incorrect time zone handling.", "utterranceID": "20270321-1-8a162"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-1-8a162"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:34:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the API to standardize all token expiry times to UTC. Additionally, I added a conversion utility to ensure that any time zone differences are correctly handled before tokens are issued.", "utterranceID": "20270321-2-48f8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-2-48f8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:36:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_86f94a48! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. This should help reduce those authentication failures we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270321-3-cd414"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-3-cd414"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob Brown! If anyone notices any further issues or has questions, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270321-4-67032"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-4-67032"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:35:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Flaw' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/68.", "utterranceID": "20270325-0-880b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-0-880b5"}

