{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-16T10:49:00", "text": "Great work, David Martinez! That should help in maintaining the performance of our database operations. Let me know if there's anything else we need to monitor.", "utterranceID": "20261116-4-95652"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261116-4-95652"}
