{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ea95d983", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:42:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect serialization of feedback data has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/43.", "utterranceID": "20270124-0-18c2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-0-18c2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_84b3cc1f", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:44:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_ea95d983! Could you give us a quick rundown of what caused the issue?", "utterranceID": "20270124-1-d31a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-1-d31a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ea95d983", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:46:00", "text": "Sure thing, George. The root cause was an incorrect implementation of data serialization methods in our client-side API integration. This led to incompatible data formats being sent to the server, which the system couldn't process.", "utterranceID": "20270124-2-af654"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-2-af654"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:51:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Emma. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270124-3-a4ab8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-3-a4ab8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ea95d983", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:52:00", "text": "I updated the serialization methods to ensure they conform to the expected data format. Specifically, I replaced the outdated JSON.stringify approach with a more robust library that handles edge cases better. This ensures the data is properly serialized before being sent to the server.", "utterranceID": "20270124-4-82e0e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-4-82e0e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_84b3cc1f", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:54:00", "text": "Awesome work, Emma! This should help prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270124-5-c5f6f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-5-c5f6f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:55:00", "text": "Agreed, @eid_ea95d983. Thanks for jumping on this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20270124-6-dd5f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-6-dd5f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahmartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-2e338c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ea95d983", "timestamp": "2027-01-24T20:57:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you encounter any other issues.", "utterranceID": "20270124-7-545cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-7-545cb"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a normalization step that ensures all user feedback is weighted equally, regardless of how frequently they provide input. This should help maintain a balanced dataset and improve model accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20261005-2-5ef82"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-2-5ef82"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:39:00", "text": "Great work, Alice! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The normalization step sounds like a solid solution.", "utterranceID": "20261005-3-e5f35"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-3-e5f35"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:44:00", "text": "@eid_54905dcb Thanks, Alice! This should definitely help with the model's performance. I'll run some tests to verify the improvements.", "utterranceID": "20261005-4-6c532"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-4-6c532"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:46:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and Hannah! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261005-5-b2821"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-5-b2821"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-05T22:51:00", "text": "Will do, Alice. I'll keep you posted on the test results.", "utterranceID": "20261005-6-c5e36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261005-6-c5e36"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:42:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Feedback Data Redundancy Causing Bloat' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/30.", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-40caa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-40caa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:43:00", "text": "The root cause was due to a lack of normalization and deduplication processes in the database schema design. This led to redundant storage of feedback data, causing database bloat and slowing down data retrieval and processing times.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-b1487"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-b1487"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:45:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a deduplication script that runs nightly to clean up redundant entries. Additionally, I updated the database schema to enforce normalization rules, ensuring that new data entries are stored efficiently. @eid_b6a30126, could you please verify the changes on your end?", "utterranceID": "20261008-2-bca92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-2-bca92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6a30126", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:47:00", "text": "Great work, Hannah! I'll check the changes and run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly. Thanks for the quick turnaround.", "utterranceID": "20261008-3-68a2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-3-68a2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:48:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing. Let me know if you need any additional testing from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261008-4-de877"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-4-de877"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a0fe567d", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T16:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and Alice! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261008-5-8e85f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-5-8e85f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T02:52:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Indexing on Feedback Tables' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/31.", "utterranceID": "20261011-0-5c9f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-0-5c9f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliemartinez-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b12786"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54905dcb", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T02:53:00", "text": "The root cause was the absence of optimized indexing strategies for the columns that are frequently queried in the feedback tables. This was causing slow query performance when retrieving user feedback for model updates.", "utterranceID": "20261011-1-388aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261011-1-388aa"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:21:00", "text": "The issue was caused by inefficient handling of asynchronous requests in the mobile UI framework, which led to the UI thread being blocked.", "utterranceID": "20261127-1-a4d26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-1-a4d26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:22:00", "text": "I optimized the asynchronous request handling by implementing a more efficient callback mechanism that prevents the UI thread from being blocked. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/36", "utterranceID": "20261127-2-9bd73"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-2-9bd73"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:25:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_e81cfe3f! This should improve the user experience significantly on mobile devices.", "utterranceID": "20261127-3-b8bb4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-3-b8bb4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:29:00", "text": "Thanks, David Martinez! I'll make sure to update the release notes with this fix. Let me know if there's anything else needed from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261127-4-5dd3b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-4-5dd3b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T13:31:00", "text": "Thanks, David Miller and Bob! I think we're all set for now. Let's keep an eye on any feedback from users after this update.", "utterranceID": "20261127-5-c4a5a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-5-c4a5a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:13:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Query Execution Plans' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/37.", "utterranceID": "20261130-0-28c0c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-0-28c0c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:17:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_e81cfe3f! Can you explain what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261130-1-a80f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-1-a80f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:21:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was outdated statistics and a lack of query optimization techniques in our database management system. This led to inefficient execution plans for complex feedback aggregation queries, which increased processing time.", "utterranceID": "20261130-2-25c8b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-2-25c8b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David Martinez. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261130-3-63884"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-3-63884"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:28:00", "text": "I updated the database statistics and implemented advanced query optimization techniques. Specifically, I enabled the use of histograms for better cardinality estimation and adjusted the cost-based optimizer settings to prioritize execution efficiency.", "utterranceID": "20261130-4-7515f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-4-7515f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:30:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, David Martinez!", "utterranceID": "20261130-5-261ff"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-5-261ff"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:34:00", "text": "Agreed, thanks for the hard work, @eid_e81cfe3f. This should help improve our system's performance significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261130-6-05b34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-6-05b34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e81cfe3f", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T00:35:00", "text": "You're welcome, Bob and David. Let me know if you notice any further issues or have any questions!", "utterranceID": "20261130-7-4ddbb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-7-4ddbb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-FeedbackForce", "channelID": "ch-force-c69b53"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-12-04T09:43:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Feedback Data Overwrite Due to Race Condition' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FeedbackForce/pull/38.", "utterranceID": "20261204-0-9922c"}, "Reactions": []}, "Thr

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:13:00", "text": "Hi team, I hope you're all doing well! 😊 I wanted to start a discussion on our new user authentication endpoint feature. I've found some interesting open-source projects that have implemented similar features. Let's dive in and see what we can learn from them!", "utterranceID": "20260519-0-7ffc5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-0-7ffc5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:14:00", "text": "First up, we have Django's implementation. They've introduced middleware to handle user authentication and session management using JWT tokens. You can check it out here: https://github.com/django/django/pull/3241. What do you think, @eid_a8040636?", "utterranceID": "20260519-1-8f00e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-1-8f00e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:19:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! The middleware approach in Django is quite robust. It integrates seamlessly with their existing session management, which is something we might want to consider. It could help us maintain a clean separation of concerns in our codebase. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260519-2-7a670"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-2-7a670"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b3fcc490", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:21:00", "text": "I agree with David. The middleware pattern is pretty neat. It might be a bit more work upfront, but it could save us time in the long run by making our authentication logic more modular. Definitely worth considering!", "utterranceID": "20260519-3-38435"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-3-38435"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:26:00", "text": "Great points, both of you! Next, let's look at Node.js. They've added a built-in module for handling JWT-based authentication. Here's the link: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/3242. Thoughts, Emma?", "utterranceID": "20260519-4-54b0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-4-54b0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b3fcc490", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:29:00", "text": "Node.js's approach is interesting because it offers a built-in solution, which could simplify things for developers. However, we need to consider if a built-in module would offer us the flexibility we need. 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260519-5-378b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-5-378b9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:31:00", "text": "True, Emma. While a built-in module is convenient, we should ensure it aligns with our specific requirements. Customizability is key for us, especially if we need to tweak the authentication process.", "utterranceID": "20260519-6-76b9b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-6-76b9b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:34:00", "text": "Absolutely, flexibility is crucial. Lastly, let's discuss Flask's JWT Authentication Blueprint. It simplifies secure user login by providing a blueprint. Check it out here: https://github.com/pallets/flask/pull/3243. What do you think, @eid_a8040636?", "utterranceID": "20260519-7-28fee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-7-28fee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:39:00", "text": "Flask's blueprint is a great example of how to make authentication setup straightforward. It could be a good model for us if we want to offer a simple setup process for developers using our endpoint. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260519-8-0bcde"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-8-0bcde"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b3fcc490", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:40:00", "text": "I like the idea of a blueprint. It could help us provide a clear and easy-to-follow structure for implementing authentication. Plus, it aligns with our goal of making the endpoint user-friendly.", "utterranceID": "20260519-9-4d9dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-9-4d9dd"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-05-19T07:42:00", "text": "Thanks for the insights, everyone! It sounds like we have some solid ideas to consider. I'll take a closer look at these features and see how we can adapt them to our needs. Let's keep the conversation going if anyone has more thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260519-10-34d17"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260519-10-34d17"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e9883de", "timestamp": "2026-05-21T11:39:00", "text": "Hi team, please check my PR for the new user authentication endpoint: https://github.com/salesforce/ghtAIX/pull/8. It adds an API endpoint for user authentication, verifies user credentials, and returns a JWT token upon successful authentication. Let me know your thoughts! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260521-0-e36e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-0-e36e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-05-21T11:41:00", "text": "Hey @eid_9e9883de, thanks for sharing! I'll take a look at it now. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260521-1-afafe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-1-afafe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b3fcc490", "timestamp": "2026-05-21T11:46:00", "text": "Checking it out too! Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_9e9883de. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260521-2-6f0e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-2-6f0e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a8040636", "timestamp": "2026-05-21T11:48:00", "text": "Alright, I've gone through the code. The API endpoint is accessible and responds correctly to authentication requests. Great job on that! 👏", "utterranceID": "20260521-3-56d63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260521-3-56d63"}
