{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:38:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Thread Starvation from Background Tasks' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/59.", "utterranceID": "20261128-0-0302c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-0-0302c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:40:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_3f4b2681! Could you give us a quick rundown of what was causing the issue?", "utterranceID": "20261128-1-db36b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-1-db36b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:41:00", "text": "Sure thing, Ian. The root cause was that our background tasks for lead scoring and qualification weren't properly prioritized. They were consuming too many resources, which led to the UI thread being starved and causing unresponsiveness during imports.", "utterranceID": "20261128-2-0e351"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-2-0e351"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:43:00", "text": "Thanks for the explanation, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261128-3-6846c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-3-6846c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:47:00", "text": "We implemented a priority queue for the background tasks, ensuring that the UI thread gets the necessary resources to remain responsive. Additionally, we optimized the lead scoring algorithm to reduce its resource consumption.", "utterranceID": "20261128-4-fb469"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-4-fb469"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:49:00", "text": "Sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Hannah!", "utterranceID": "20261128-5-38d39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-5-38d39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:53:00", "text": "Agreed, great work @eid_3f4b2681. This should make a big difference for our users.", "utterranceID": "20261128-6-342b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-6-342b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-28T11:55:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you encounter any more issues. Happy to help!", "utterranceID": "20261128-7-1682c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261128-7-1682c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Security Vulnerability in Lead Data Export' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/60.", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-4e189"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-4e189"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:19:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Can you explain what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-7f34a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-7f34a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:24:00", "text": "Sure, Hannah. The root cause was that the export module lacked proper encryption protocols for securing data during file generation. This led to sensitive lead information being exposed during the export process.", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-b3825"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-b3825"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:29:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-d5d00"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-d5d00"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:32:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I implemented AES-256 encryption for the exported files. This ensures that all sensitive lead data is securely encrypted during the export process. Additionally, I added a verification step to ensure that the encryption is applied correctly before the files are made available for download.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-6aca5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-6aca5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-12-02T05:33:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix, Ian. Thanks for handling this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-c2ea5"}

