{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:52:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Requirements Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some areas to address, especially around AI misclassification, UI intuitiveness, CRM integration, performance, and reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260414-0-620b1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-0-620b1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:53:00", "text": "Hey @eid_8efef28a, for the AI misclassification issue, I think we should add a section on enhancing our training data strategy. We need more diverse datasets and regular retraining schedules to keep the model sharp. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260414-1-c0b29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-1-c0b29"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4f30e22e", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T15:58:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian. Also, we should incorporate user feedback loops in the 'Future Enhancements' section to improve the UI. This will help address the steep learning curve new users face. Maybe a dedicated UX research phase? @eid_8efef28a", "utterranceID": "20260414-2-1bff4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-2-1bff4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T16:00:00", "text": "For the CRM integration issue, we should consider expanding the 'System Architecture' section to include a more modular approach. This will help us support a wider range of CRM systems more easily. @eid_8efef28a", "utterranceID": "20260414-3-372a2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-3-372a2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T16:05:00", "text": "On the performance front, we need to add a section on performance monitoring and scaling strategies. This will help us manage peak usage times better. Maybe we can include some automated scaling solutions? 🤖", "utterranceID": "20260414-4-14d52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-4-14d52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f01e31", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T16:10:00", "text": "For reliability, let's ensure we have robust monitoring and alerting mechanisms in place. We should add this to the 'Security and Compliance' section to emphasize its importance. @eid_8efef28a", "utterranceID": "20260414-5-86af8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-5-86af8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-14T16:14:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a quick summary: \n- Enhance training data strategy and regular retraining for AI.\n- Incorporate user feedback and UX research for UI improvements.\n- Expand modular architecture for CRM integrations.\n- Add performance monitoring and scaling strategies.\n- Strengthen monitoring and alerting for reliability.\n\nLet's update the document with these changes and schedule a follow-up meeting to finalize. Thanks, team! 🎉", "utterranceID": "20260414-6-09435"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260414-6-09435"}
