{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T12:00:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! 🎉 To summarize, we'll update the NLP Engine for sarcasm detection, enhance Slack integration strategies, improve UI design and onboarding, optimize performance for large teams, and expand customization options. I'll draft these changes and share them for final review. Next steps: let's aim to finalize the document by the end of the week. Thanks, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260420-8-5e011"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-8-5e011"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fd8cecea", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T19:39:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_imentaix_product_requirements_document|Product Requirements Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260420-0-df31a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-0-df31a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-imentAIX", "channelID": "ch-ntaix-141b6b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5890ce38", "timestamp": "2026-04-23T02:56:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Technical Specifications Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the sentiment analysis misinterpretation, Slack integration inconsistencies, UI challenges, performance issues with large teams, and limited customization options. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260422-0-577e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260422-0-577e1"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:56:00", "text": "Awesome! Lastly, there's a 'Security Vulnerability in User Authentication'. There's a flaw allowing unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which is a big privacy concern. This affects the User Authentication Module and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0105. @eid_fa6ec727, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20260930-5-2031a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-5-2031a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:57:00", "text": "Understood. I'll prioritize fixing this security issue to ensure data privacy. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260930-6-8fbe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-6-8fbe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T17:02:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and secure. If you need any more details or run into issues, just ping me. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260930-7-fa4cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-7-fa4cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T17:06:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_d96fb219!", "utterranceID": "20260930-8-690f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-8-690f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T17:10:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d96fb219! Let's get these sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260930-9-59ef7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-9-59ef7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T23:56:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261002-0-ee9a1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-0-ee9a1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T23:58:00", "text": "First, there's a bug in TensorFlow titled 'Incorrect Emoji Sentiment Classification'. It seems their sentiment analysis model is also misclassifying emojis, similar to our SentimentForce issue. You can check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/163. @eid_4df5d4b7, this might give you some insights!", "utterranceID": "20261002-1-852a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-1-852a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:03:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their fixes to our emoji interpretation logic. It's always good to see how others tackle similar problems. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261002-2-5fbbd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-2-5fbbd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:06:00", "text": "Next up, we have a PostgreSQL issue titled 'Suboptimal Query Execution Plans'. Their query planner is generating inefficient execution plans, which sounds a lot like our database issue. Here's the link: https://github.com/postgres/postgres/pull/164. Fiona, this might be useful for you!", "utterranceID": "20261002-3-bfd04"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-3-bfd04"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:08:00", "text": "Great find, Emma! I'll dive into their PR and see if there are any optimization strategies we can adopt. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261002-4-7518d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-4-7518d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:10:00", "text": "Lastly, there's a security flaw in Keycloak's authentication module, allowing unauthorized access to user data. This is quite similar to our security vulnerability. Check it out here: https://github.com/keycloak/keycloak/pull/165. Fiona, since you're already on the security issue, this might be helpful!", "utterranceID": "20261002-5-9284c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-5-9284c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:12:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll look into their fix and see if it can guide us in patching our vulnerability. Security is a top priority! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261002-6-5a0d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-6-5a0d4"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T04:06:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_13cb0e90! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. The scheduled defragmentation sounds like a solid solution.", "utterranceID": "20261113-3-22814"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-3-22814"}
