{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CoFoAIX", "channelID": "ch-foaix-dc24bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b48f959b", "timestamp": "2026-05-27T00:52:00", "text": "Sounds good, Ian. One last thing, in the Technology Stack section, could we mention any plans for future technology upgrades or evaluations? It might be useful for stakeholders to know we're planning ahead. @eid_99835861", "utterranceID": "20260526-5-2fde7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260526-5-2fde7"}
